      <p source="#source-343-360"><seg source="#source-343-360">めざめよ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-360-380"><seg source="#source-360-380">み空の金鑛、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-380-412"><seg source="#source-380-412">かなしくうたうたひ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-412-432"><seg source="#source-412-432">なみだたれ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-432-473"><seg source="#source-432-473">われのみ土地を掘らんとす、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-473-493"><seg source="#source-473-493">土地は黥青、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-493-572"><seg source="#source-493-508">なやましき</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-508-556" corresp="#source-520-556"><seg source="#source-508-520">しやべる</seg></hi><seg source="#source-556-572">ぞ光る。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-572-607"><seg source="#source-572-607">ああくらき緑をやぶり、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-607-639"><seg source="#source-607-639">天上よりきたるの光、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-639-662"><seg source="#source-639-662">いま秋ふかみ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-662-679"><seg source="#source-662-679">あふげば、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-679-713"><seg source="#source-679-713">一脈の金は空にあり。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-713-730"><seg source="#source-713-730">めざめよ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-730-750"><seg source="#source-730-750">み空の金鑛、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-750-782"><seg source="#source-750-782">かなしくうたうたひ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-782-802"><seg source="#source-782-802">なみだたれ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-802-843"><seg source="#source-802-843">われなほ土地を掘らんとす。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-843-885" style="padding-inline-start: 14em">
        <p source="#source-867-885"><seg source="#source-867-885">―九月二日―</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
